g=A.d([A.h(a7,a7,A.f().$1$fontSize(12),"Your journey begins upon arrival in Delhi, where you'll be warmly welcomed. Delhi, a city where ancient history meets modern progress, is a prime example of India\u2019s historical importance. The city\u2019s strategic location has made it the seat of many rulers throughout history, and today it stands as the capital of India. After settling in at your hotel, you will embark on a half-day tour to visit some of Delhi\u2019s most significant landmarks. You will see the majestic Jama Masjid, Chandni Chowk, and the iconic Red Fort in Old Delhi, before moving on to explore New Delhi. Here, you'll witness the grandeur of Raj Ghat, India Gate, President\u2019s House, Humayun\u2019s Tomb, and Qutub Minar. You can choose to end your day with an optional Sound & Light Show at the Red Fort, followed by a traditional dinner at Chor Bizarre. Overnight stay at your hotel in Delhi.")],i)
