e=A.d([A.h(c1,c1,A.f().$0(),"Ahmedabad, the largest city in Gujarat, is located on the banks of the Sabarmati River. It is renowned for its connection to Mahatma Gandhi and is home to his famous Ashram, which is a significant historical site. The city is also a treasure trove of architectural marvels, including:\n\nAhmed Shah\u2019s Tomb and Mosque: \nThe tomb of the founder of Ahmedabad is a peaceful spot, and the mosque showcases Islamic architecture.\nJama Masjid: A beautiful example of Indo-Saracenic architecture\n\nSidi Sayid Mosque:\nFamous for its intricate stone lattice work.\nTeen Darwaza: A historical gateway, one of the prominent structures from the Mughal era.\n\nKankaria Lake: \nA large circular lake offering boat rides, a zoo, and a park.\nVictoria Gardens and Calico Textile Museum: Known for textile art and exhibits of fabric and fashion.\n\nN C Mehta Museum of Miniatures: \nA collection of exquisite miniature art.\n\nThe city is also known for its 'pols' \u2013 traditional residential colonies from the 18th century, offering a glimpse into old-world Ahmedabad.\n")],g)
