g=A.d([A.h(a1,a1,A.f().$0(),"Located at an elevation of 2433.4 meters above sea level, Dzukou Valley is one of the most renowned trekking destinations in Nagaland. The gentle, rolling hills of the valley offer a peaceful ambiance, making it a perfect spot for trekkers, nature lovers, and meditation groups.\n\nWhat Makes It Special:\nThe valley is blessed with a rich ecosystem of flora and fauna.\nDuring the summer months, the valley turns into a beautiful garden with a variety of wildflowers, including Lilium, Caltha palustris, Mackliniae, and Anemone.\nThe meandering streams and undulating rivulets that flow through the valley add to its beauty.\n\nDzukou Valley offers tranquility and serenity, making it a perfect place for reflection and peace.")],j)
