i=A.j("Key Tourist Attractions in Jeypore:",a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,A.e(j,h,a1,i,a1,a1,A.b().gh().gi().x,B.a,0,a1,!1),a1,a1,a1,a1)
h=A.p(a3,a1,r).w.gk()
j=t.R
g=A.d([A.h(a1,a1,A.q(a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,!0,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1,a1),'Bagra Waterfall\n Located near the Kolab River, Bagra Waterfall is a popular picnic spot known for its stunning natural beauty. The waterfall cascades through dense foliage, creating a moonlit stream that offers a breathtaking sight. It\u2019s an ideal place to relax and soak in the tranquil surroundings.\n\n\nGupteshwar Cave Temple\n The sacred Gupteshwar Cave Temple is one of the prominent pilgrimage sites in Jeypore. Dedicated to Lord Shiva, the temple houses a hidden lingam (a symbol of Shiva) concealed within rocks, which gives the temple its name\u2014Gupteshwar, meaning "hidden rock." The temple attracts pilgrims, especially during the Shivaratri festival, when visitors offer flowers, fruits, and sweets. The panoramic views from the temple also make it a must-visit for non-believers.\n\n\nMinna Jhola\n Minna Jhola is a scenic spot nestled in the dense forest, offering sweeping views of the surrounding nature. At the confluence of three rivers, it is home to a small temple dedicated to Lord Shiva. The calm and serene atmosphere makes it an ideal place for nature lovers and peace seekers.\n\n\nKolab Botanical Garden\n Situated beside the Kolab Reservoir, the Kolab Botanical Garden is a picturesque picnic spot known for its vast collection of over 200 species of flowering plants. The garden\u2019s natural beauty is enhanced by its tranquil ambiance, making it the perfect place to witness stunning sunsets. It is an excellent spot for photography and a relaxing day out.\n\n\nDuduma Waterfall\n Duduma Waterfall, formed by the Machkund River, is one of the highest waterfalls in the region. Surrounded by thick deciduous forests, the waterfall offers a mesmerizing sight, especially when viewed against the backdrop of a babbling stream. Spending a night in this area allows you to fully appreciate the natural beauty and serenity of the place.')],j)
