g=A.d([A.h(a,a,A.q(a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,!0,a,a,a,a,a,a,a,a),"Taragarh Fort\n Taragarh Fort, also known as the Star Fort, is a massive 16th-century fort that exemplifies ancient architecture. Visitors can enter through the Hathia Pol (Elephant Gateway), which is adorned with painted elephant figures. Inside the fort, explore the Chattar Mahal and Chitrashala, famous for their legendary paintings.\nBundi Palace\n Located near Taragarh Fort, Bundi Palace was built between 1607 and 1631 AD by Rao Raja Ratan Singh Hada. The palace has stunning architecture with \u201cPhool Mahal\u201d and \u201cBadal Mahal\u201d showcasing intricate designs. The ceilings, inspired by Chinese art, feature petal shapes and vibrant depictions of peacocks and Krishnas.\nRamgarh Vishdhari Sanctuary\n Situated 15 km from Bundi, the Ramgarh Vishdhari Sanctuary is home to diverse wildlife, including leopards, sambar, wild boar, and Indian wolves. Established in 1982, the sanctuary spans 252.79 sq km and offers a great experience for nature lovers.\n84 Pillared Cenotaph\n The 84 Pillared Cenotaph, also known as Chaurasi Khambon Ki Chhatri, is a striking architectural monument supported by 84 columns, adorned with artistic figures. It is a remarkable example of classic architecture.\nNawal Sagar\n Nawal Sagar is a picturesque lake with a half-submerged temple dedicated to Varuna, the Aryan god of water. The beauty of the lake, with its reflection of the city, captivates visitors and adds to Bundi\u2019s charm.\nSukh Mahal\n Sukh Mahal, situated by Sukh Sagar Lake, is a beautiful summer palace surrounded by gardens. The palace is said to have an underground tunnel connecting it to the old palace in the city, adding an air of mystery to its allure.\nBundi Festival (November)\n The Bundi Festival, held annually in November, is a lively celebration filled with traditional music, dance, sports, and competitions. The festival kicks off with a Shobha Yatra (procession) and features cultural programs, folk dances, bridal attire competitions, and spectacular fireworks.")],j)
