h=A.d([A.h(a,a,A.f().$0(),"Ooty, a gem nestled in the Nilgiri range, offers a vibrant mix of culture, traditions, and natural beauty. This picturesque hill station, with its rolling blue mountains, lush forests, and sprawling tea estates, is a perfect escape into nature\u2019s embrace. What sets Ooty apart from other hill stations is not just its beauty but its popularity among honeymooners. Newly-wedded couples from around the world flock to this serene wonderland to celebrate the beginning of their life together. The idyllic setting provides a charming backdrop for creating memorable moments, making it one of the most sought-after romantic destinations.")],i)
