c=A.d([A.h(a0,a0,A.q(a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,!0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0,a0),"Mussoorie experiences a pleasant climate throughout the year, making it a year-round destination. The best time to visit is between April and June, as the weather is mild and ideal for sightseeing. September to November is also a great time to visit when the region is lush and green. It is advisable to avoid the monsoon season (July to September) as heavy rainfall can disrupt travel plans. Winters (December to February) bring snow and chilly weather, but roads may be blocked due to snowfall.")],j)
