f=A.d([A.h(a2,a2,A.f().$0(),"The main tourist attraction in Mirik is the Sumendu Lake, a man-made lake surrounded by a 1.25 km long road and offering breathtaking views of Mt. Kanchenjunga. Though swimming is prohibited, the lake is a popular spot for boating, providing visitors with an idyllic natural setting. A few kilometers from the lake lies the Bokar Gompa, home to Mahayana monks, where visitors can worship and seek spiritual blessings. Additionally, there are several temples dedicated to Shiva, Hanuman, and Kali Mata, visited by devotees daily.\n\nFor those who enjoy scenic viewpoints, Deosi Dara offers spectacular views of the plains, hills, and surrounding peaks, making it a popular spot for nature lovers. Rameetay Dara is an ideal location for watching the sunrise and sunset, with beautiful views of the mountains and plains. Another viewpoint, Kawlay Dara, provides breathtaking vistas of Mirik and its surroundings, perfect for capturing the natural beauty of the area.")],h)
