g=A.d([A.h(d,d,A.e(j,d,d,h,d,d,A.b().gh().gi().x,g.w,0,d,!1),"Embark on a spiritually enriching journey across the Indo-Gangetic plains, from the sacred city of Kashi to the divine banks of Haridwar and Rishikesh. This tour is designed to offer Hindu devotees a complete pilgrimage experience \u2014 performing sacred rituals and darshans at some of the most revered places in India. A journey of a lifetime for the soul.\n\nDetailed Itinerary:\nDay 1: Arrival in Varanasi\nReceive a warm welcome at Varanasi and transfer to the hotel. In the afternoon, visit temples such as Mother India Temple, Durga Temple, Tulsi Manas Temple, Sankat Mochan, and the New Vishwanath Temple. End the day with the mesmerizing Ganga Aarti at Dasaswamedh Ghat. Overnight stay at the hotel.\n\nDay 2: Varanasi \u2013 Vindhyachal \u2013 Prayagraj \u2013 Train to Agra\nEarly morning boat ride on the Ganges to witness life at the ghats. Return for breakfast. Later, drive to Allahabad via Vindhyachal and visit Vindyavasini Devi Temple. In the evening, board an overnight train to Agra.\n\nDay 3: Agra \u2013 Mathura\nArrive in Agra and transfer to the hotel. After breakfast, explore the iconic Taj Mahal and Agra Fort. You may also choose an optional visit to Fatehpur Sikri. In the evening, travel to Mathura and visit key religious sites. Overnight in Mathura.\n\nDay 4: Mathura \u2013 Vrindavan\nAfter breakfast, explore Vrindavan, the land of Krishna\u2019s pastimes, and visit Brij Bhumi. Overnight stay in Mathura.\n\nDay 5: Mathura \u2013 Delhi\nDepart for Delhi by road. In the afternoon, explore both Old and New Delhi, visiting major attractions and temples. Overnight at the hotel.\n\nDay 6: Delhi \u2013 Haridwar \u2013 Rishikesh (Approx. 224 km)\nAfter breakfast, drive to Rishikesh, stopping en route for a tour of Haridwar. Visit famous temples and ghats. Check-in at your hotel in Rishikesh. Overnight stay.\n\nDay 7: Rishikesh & Haridwar Sightseeing\nSpend the day exploring Rishikesh \u2014 visit Laxman Jhula, Laxman Temple, Neelkanth Mahadev, Bharat Mandir, and enjoy panoramic views of the Himalayan foothills. Overnight in Rishikesh.\n\nDay 8: Rishikesh \u2013 Delhi \u2013 Departure\nAfter breakfast, drive back to Delhi. Transfer to the airport or railway station for your onward journey \u2014 carrying divine memories with you.")],t.R)
