c=A.d([A.h(a4,a4,A.f().$0(),"Breakfast at the hotel. Take a brief city tour of Colombo (for customers staying in Colombo) or Negombo (for customers staying in Negombo), then proceed to the Cultural Triangle via Pinnawela.\n\nColombo, the country\u2019s commercial capital, is a bustling city that drives over 50% of the national GDP. The city is known for its urban development, clean streets, and proximity to the ocean. It also has the historic Racecourse, once a World War II airstrip, now home to boutique shops offering clothing, food, and tea.\n\nNegombo, known for its cinnamon production and Dutch colonial history, offers beautiful beaches and diving opportunities. It is famous for its seafood, including lobsters, prawns, and crabs.\n\nOn the way, visit the Elephant Orphanage, where orphaned elephants roam freely. The highlight of the visit is watching the elephants bathe in the nearby river at 10:00 am and 2:00 pm daily, providing great photo opportunities.\n\nIf time permits, visit the Dambulla Cave Temple, which dates back to the 1st century B.C. The temple is renowned for its unique paintings and over 150 statues of Lord Buddha.\n\nDinner and overnight stay at the hotel.")],d)
