g=A.d([A.h(a4,a4,A.f().$1$fontSize(12),'Arrive via an international flight. After a traditional "Swagat" (welcome), our representative will assist you with the transfer to your hotel for check-in.\n\nDelhi, the vibrant capital of India, seamlessly blends ancient traditions with modernity. This city has witnessed the rise and fall of numerous dynasties, beginning with the ancient city of Indraprastha from the Mahabharata, dating back to around 5000 BC. Over the centuries, rulers like Qutub-ud-din Aibek, Alauddin Khilji, the Tughlaqs, Humayun, and Shah Jahan built iconic structures here.\n\nIn the early 20th century, the British architect Sir Edwin Lutyens designed New Delhi, leaving behind a legacy of grand architecture that stands as a testament to British colonial rule.\n\nOvernight Stay: Hotel in Delhi (B)')],j)
