f=A.p(a8,a4,r).w.gk()
d=A.d([A.h(a4,a4,A.q(a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,!0,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4,a4),"The day begins with a guided tour of Old Delhi, including the 17th-century Shah Jahanabad. Key highlights include the Jama Masjid, one of India\u2019s largest and most exquisite mosques, built in 1656 AD by Emperor Shah Jahan. Stroll or enjoy a rickshaw ride through Chandni Chowk, a bustling bazaar that leads to the iconic Red Fort, built in 1648.\n\nIn New Delhi, visit Raj Ghat, the resting place of Mahatma Gandhi, and drive past India Gate, a war memorial from 1931 that honors Indian soldiers of World War I and the Afghan Wars. The Rashtrapati Bhawan (Presidential Residence) and the surrounding administrative buildings showcase British-era architectural grandeur.\n\nOther highlights include Humayun's Tomb, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, and Qutub Minar, the 72-meter brick minaret built in 1206 by Qutub-ud-din Aibek.\n\nOvernight Stay: Hotel in Delhi (B)")],j)
